Imagine the extra 5Ds that could happen to you on this ride.

00:53:10.420 --> 00:53:11.780
So, all right.

00:53:11.900 --> 00:53:15.960
So, I've actually been to Atlantic City more recently than we went.

00:53:17.520 --> 00:53:23.640
But, it is, it's in some ways, like, I was able to experience better things.

00:53:23.940 --> 00:53:35.280
First of all, I would just like to stand up for the denizens of Atlantic City and say that they have impeccable, beautiful beaches.

00:53:36.040 --> 00:53:37.700
We did not go to the beach.

00:53:37.800 --> 00:53:39.860
I don't know what time of year we went.

00:53:40.720 --> 00:53:42.840
I feel like it was not beach weather.

00:53:43.480 --> 00:53:54.880
But, like, you know, between, like, a Rockaway Beach and an Atlantic City Beach, Atlantic City Beach, 7 days out of 7.

00:53:55.280 --> 00:53:56.400
Like, hell yeah.

00:53:57.360 --> 00:54:01.180
But, we also, I was also, like, off the boardwalk pretty often.

00:54:01.180 --> 00:54:04.220
