Monopoly Gaiden. Right?

00:57:15.680 --> 00:57:18.480
But, like, just call it Monopoly 2 then, right?

00:57:19.400 --> 00:57:20.540
The Monopoly Game.

00:57:20.680 --> 00:57:23.240
Well, because they want to make sure you're not confusing it with the game show.

00:57:23.900 --> 00:57:27.660
