00:57:28.080 --> 00:57:29.460
Right? Like, Monopoly 2.

00:57:29.460 --> 00:57:31.200
Like, oh, this is the answer to Monopoly.

00:57:31.620 --> 00:57:34.280
But just call the first one the Monopoly Game then.

00:57:34.680 --> 00:57:36.520
Yeah, right. They didn't think ahead.

00:57:37.120 --> 00:57:43.460
Yep. They maybe should not have just not have landed on the number two.

